type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
title: 'twfeweights: Implicit Weights and Covariate Balance for Difference-in-Differences Estimators'
version: 1.0.0
abstract: Computes the implicit weights that two-way fixed effects (TWFE) regressions
  and other difference-in-differences estimators place on group-time average treatment
  effects and on individual units, and uses them to assess covariate balance.
